      "content": "hey so my knee is killing me today, the osteoarthritis is flaring up really bad. i usually just take some ibuprofen when it gets like this but i forgot if i'm allowed to take it since i'm on eliquis for my afib. how much ibuprofen can i safely take to get the swelling down?",
